  "html": "\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하임달 \n미드가드에서 같이 생활할 길드원을 모집합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관심있으신분은</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">게임상에서</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">/who \nholy로 검색하여 리스트된 길드원에게 가입의사를 귓말로 보내주시거나</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">DAOC를 \n처음 접하시는분은 <a href=\"http://daoc.co.kr\">http://daoc.co.kr</a> 사이트에서 \n계정생성과</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:40;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">정보를 \n접하시거나 <a href=\"mailto:forg@hananet.net\">forg@hananet.net</a> 으로 가입문의를 \n해주시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n",
